 million gamers, China is the world's largest gaming market — but it's also one of the most tightly regulated. The effects reach far beyond China, impacting players around the world.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>UK students call for school uniforms to be banned in pornography</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:56a476a6ea5ad2cfa8e496eb6b8050a61638ae39e9d71ac890ab6191ec8af9df</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T07:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-students-call-for-school-uniforms-to-be-banned-in-pornography/a-79554324--e21f080b6070.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-students-call-for-school-uniforms-to-be-banned-in-pornography/a-79554324?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Short skirts, knee-high socks, white blouses: Girls' school uniform items are widely used as costumes in pornographic videos. As students experience harassment, a group wants to change that.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>'Ragebait' is the 2026 German Youth Word of the Year</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b10eab4e9ff7aeff99e9773ba4d8107025560d7096428d4c0fdfd82d4ff34f44</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T13:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158--c39c4c350c71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Already named the 2025 Oxford Word of the Year, "rage bait" has also been widely adopted in German slang.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Is China seeking to restrict Taiwan's cultural presence?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f50c3d29b37cb9145c366988e71b7d0ef87127c6a2f87db0cc296ba6bf7d04b3</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:34Z</updated><publis